Error [jet.TraitNotImplemented]: `U` isn't `Priced`
  --> tests/ui/conditional_impl_unmet_bound.jet:24:46
    |
 24 | loose: fn<U>(pair: Pair<U>) -> String { pair.describe() }
    |                                              ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `describe` comes from a conditional impl that applies only where `T` is `Priced`, and here `T` is `U`
 Fix: Declare the bound where `U` is introduced: `<U: Priced>`
